  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "獨立研究(二)",
    "sub_ename": "INDEPENDENT STUDY(2)",
    "describe_ch": "獨立研究(二)是引導學生往更深層次去探索個人興趣的機會，以決定未來的學習方式與方向。本課程也可以作為是對遠距學習的理解。指導教授與學生透過討論，擬定未來研究方向架構及題目，以進行資料蒐集、實驗設計及規劃等研究工作。",
    "describe_eh": "Independent study (2)  refers to opportunities for students to explore their personal interests on a deeper level in order to decide how and where they will direct their studies in the future. This course can also be understood is to understand learning from a distance. A student and professor will generally agree upon a topic for the student to research with minimal instruction and guidance from the professor for an agreed upon number of academic credits.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
